{"id":"n23894-1-11","stage":4,"title":"농장 · 农场","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n23894-1-11-1","ko":"저기는 왜 저렇게 돼지가 많아요?","zh":"那边为什么有这么多猪啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저기는","meaning":"那里，那儿","explanation":"저기：那里，那儿；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"저기","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71218","senseId":"1","lemma":"저기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저기는","audio":"/audio/b0a619d5e92980791609.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么。","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"저렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"저렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"저렇다","audio":"/audio/07e99c1628a5077b51a7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71226","senseId":"1","lemma":"저렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저렇게","audio":"/audio/3e51b4147d3689f85089.mp3"}},{"text":"돼지가","meaning":"猪","explanation":"돼지：猪；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"돼지","audio":"/audio/7ecd93cd424c9eb2cbfc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62269","senseId":"1","lemma":"돼지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돼지가","audio":"/audio/57c77bca2cade259242e.mp3"}},{"text":"많아요?","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많아요","audio":"/audio/e2d2cc074c8e28c555ca.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1a8b5723b01cfd93","term":"저기","zh":"那里，那儿","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3","entryId":"71218","definition":"指代离说话人或听话人很远的地方。","pronunciation":["저기"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"07e99c1628a5077b","term":"저렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/07e99c1628a5077b51a7.mp3","entryId":"71226","definition":"性质、模样、状态等与那个一样。","pronunciation":["저러타"]},{"id":"7ecd93cd424c9eb2","term":"돼지","zh":"猪","audio":"/audio/7ecd93cd424c9eb2cbfc.mp3","entryId":"62269","definition":"为了食其肉而饲养的动物，身体肥胖、腿和尾巴短小、眼睛较小。","pronunciation":["돼ː지"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/3bcd8a7dcdffc4a31a6c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n23894-1-11-2","ko":"돼지 농장이라서 많은 돼지들을 기르고 있는 곳이거든.","zh":"因为那是养猪场，所以才养了那么多猪的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"돼지","meaning":"猪","explanation":"돼지：猪。","readings":[{"term":"돼지","audio":"/audio/7ecd93cd424c9eb2cbfc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62269","senseId":"1","lemma":"돼지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돼지","audio":"/audio/7ecd93cd424c9eb2cbfc.mp3"}},{"text":"농장이라서","meaning":"农场","explanation":"농장：农场；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；라서：名词判断或 아니다 后的原因表达：“因为是、因为不是”。","readings":[{"term":"농장","audio":"/audio/3b44e548e76cad275210.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23894","senseId":"1","lemma":"농장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"농장이라서","audio":"/audio/a052a2bbb4e1735a52d2.mp3"}},{"text":"많은","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많은","audio":"/audio/dac1aa733d550e544bce.mp3"}},{"text":"돼지들을","meaning":"猪","explanation":"돼지：猪；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"돼지","audio":"/audio/7ecd93cd424c9eb2cbfc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62269","senseId":"1","lemma":"돼지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돼지들을","audio":"/audio/927a84b4fedc35074288.mp3"}},{"text":"기르고","meaning":"养，喂养，饲养，栽培","explanation":"기르다：养，喂养，饲养，栽培；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"기르다","audio":"/audio/8b121394eb596253aeec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62242","senseId":"1","lemma":"기르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기르고","audio":"/audio/796ebc4d48df0a510d10.mp3"}},{"text":"있는","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있는","audio":"/audio/9714c770db7ebcb9f4f1.mp3"}},{"text":"곳이거든.","meaning":"地方，地区","explanation":"곳：地方，地区；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；거든：补充理由或背景，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"곳","audio":"/audio/24875f860934407bb8fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18661","senseId":"1","lemma":"곳","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"곳이거든","audio":"/audio/f626f8e1f32b68c02832.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"7ecd93cd424c9eb2","term":"돼지","zh":"猪","audio":"/audio/7ecd93cd424c9eb2cbfc.mp3","entryId":"62269","definition":"为了食其肉而饲养的动物，身体肥胖、腿和尾巴短小、眼睛较小。","pronunciation":["돼ː지"]},{"id":"3b44e548e76cad27","term":"농장","zh":"农场","audio":"/audio/3b44e548e76cad275210.mp3","entryId":"23894","definition":"配备农地、器具、家畜等农耕所需的东西以经营农业的地方。","pronunciation":["농장"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]},{"id":"8b121394eb596253","term":"기르다","zh":"养，喂养，饲养，栽培","audio":"/audio/8b121394eb596253aeec.mp3","entryId":"62242","definition":"给动物食物或给植物养分，并予以保护，使其成长。","pronunciation":["기르다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行